OL,5,G2100 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,6,     FA 52-year-old man complains of
OL,7,     Fneck and shoulder pains after
OL,8,     Fbeing thrown off his motorbike,
OL,9,     Fand a 40-year-old epileptic woman
OL,10,     Fhas collapsed with a dangerously
OL,11,     Flow breathing rate.
OL,12,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,13,     FA&E staff tackle night shifts,
OL,14,     Fmanaging severe trauma, violence,
OL,15,     Fand complex cases, including a man
OL,16,     Fwith severed fingers, a farmer
OL,17,     Fwith hand injuries, and a possible
OL,18,     Fheart attack.
